  "ruleText": "Env-A 3804.01 Use Limitation. GHG VERs registered in accordance with this chapter shall not be converted to tradable credits or used under any circumstances unless and until this chapter is amended to establish a trading program.\n\nSource. #7456, eff 2-24-01; ss by #9393, INTERIM, eff 2-24-09, EXPIRES: 8-24-09; ss by #9470, eff 5-16-09\n\nRULE | STATE OR FEDERAL STATUTE\n\nEnv-A 3800 | RSA 125-L",
